									<p>Want immediate results while your SEO builds momentum? Our paid advertising campaigns generate qualified patient inquiries starting day one.</p><p>We manage high-performance PPC campaigns across:  </p><ul><li><strong>Google Ads </strong>targeting high-intent searches (&#8220;hearing aids near me,&#8221; &#8220;best audiologist in [city]&#8221;)</li><li><strong>Facebook &amp; Instagram </strong>ads reaching your ideal patient demographics</li><li><strong>Retargeting campaigns </strong>that bring back website visitors who didn&#8217;t book the first time</li></ul><p>Every dollar you spend is tracked, optimized, and measured against one metric: <strong>patient acquisition </strong>cost. If an ad isn&#8217;t generating appointments, we kill it and reallocate budget to what works.</p><p>Most agencies waste your money on clicks that don&#8217;t convert. We focus obsessively on audiology patient acquisition that directly impacts your bottom line.</p>								</div>
